{"id":"719f56999c0853ae","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-definition-complete-representation.md","title":"Consistency Converts Definition to Complete Representation","display":"lem-definition-complete-representation — Consistency Converts Definition to Complete Representation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-definition-complete-representation","aliases":["92-lem-definition-complete-representation"],"display":"lem-definition-complete-representation — Consistency Converts Definition to Complete Representation","source":"第 VIII 章 p. 97，Proposition 1（PDF 114）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-complete-representability]]","[[92-df-consistent]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-definition-complete-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-definition-complete-representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-definition-complete-representation — Consistency Converts Definition to Complete Representation"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII 章 p. 97，Proposition 1（PDF 114）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e5790b58acf0fb1c\" href=\"?note=e5790b58acf0fb1c\" title=\"92-df-complete-representability\">92-df-complete-representability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是具有指定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个自由变量的公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^k,\\mathrm{CRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k\">\\(\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^k,\\mathrm{CRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k\\)</span> 来自<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e5790b58acf0fb1c\" href=\"?note=e5790b58acf0fb1c\" title=\"92-df-complete-representability\">92-df-complete-representability</a>，分别是数码定义与完全表示关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}definition\\text{-}complete\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{CRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}definition\\text{-}complete\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{CRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向两个条件已由定义给出。若非成员的正实例可证，则其否定也由定义可证，违背一致性；若成员的负实例可证，则正实例也可证，同样矛盾。因此可证与可反驳各自获得反向蕴涵。证明未使用可靠性或有效性。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII 章 p. 97，Proposition 1（PDF 114）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-complete-representability","status":"resolved","id":"e5790b58acf0fb1c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-complete-representability]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-complete-representability","status":"resolved","id":"e5790b58acf0fb1c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^k,\\mathrm{CRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k$ 来自[[92-df-complete-representability]]，分别是数码定义与完全表示关系。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^k,\\mathrm{CRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}definition\\text{-}complete\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{CRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A).","display":true}],"bytes":1508,"backlinks":[{"id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"沿用 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 标签与符号，实际语义是原书第 VIII 章的 numeralwise definition：正确正实例与正确负实例分别可证。它不是原书第 V 章 representable 的“成员当且仅当正实例可证”。普通表示见[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]；完全表示的双条件见[[92-df-complete-representability]]；一致性把本定义的同一见证提升为完全表示，见[[92-lem-definition-complete-representation]]。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-complete-representability]]与[[92-lem-definition-complete-representation]]区分双侧定义和完全表示。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-229","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-definition-complete-representation]]"}],"outgoing":["e5790b58acf0fb1c","c7befd96bd551ade"]}